    "body": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded specifies _something_, but nowhere is it matched with a defined term of a \"query parameter\" - so it's not helpful from a normative reference standpoint. \r\n\r\nRFC3986 likewise defines the query component, and even makes passing reference to key=value pairs, but likewise does not define a \"query parameter\" or the rules for composing or parsing one.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
